---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | ByteLite LLC"
  description="Privacy policy for the ByteLite LLC website and Cordel ecosystem."
  keywords="ByteLite LLC privacy policy"
  
>
  <Header slot="header" />

  <section class="legal-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="legal-sub">Last updated: July 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container legal-body">

      <div class="legal-section">
        <h2>Overview</h2>
        <p>ByteLite LLC is committed to privacy as a design requirement, not a legal checkbox. This policy describes what data is collected through this website and under what conditions.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="legal-section">
        <h2>What this website collects</h2>
        <h3>Contact form submissions</h3>
        <p>If you submit the contact form, your name, email address, inquiry type, message, and optionally an organization name and one workflow detail (quantity interest or device platform) are submitted to an endpoint on this site. Your IP address is used to enforce a submission rate limit. This data is used solely to respond to your inquiry. It is not sold, shared with third parties, or used for marketing.</p>
        <p>No third-party email or CRM provider is currently configured for this form. Submissions are validated and recorded server-side so that an inquiry is not silently lost.</p>
        <h3>Analytics</h3>
        <p><strong>No analytics provider is currently loaded on this website.</strong> No Google Analytics tag, no other analytics script, and no advertising or tracking script is served by any page. If privacy-respecting analytics are added in future, they will run only where you have recorded consent through the cookie preferences described below, and this policy will be updated before that happens.</p>
        <h3>Cookies and local storage</h3>
        <p>This website does not set advertising cookies. The only value it stores in your browser is your cookie-consent choice, kept in your browser's local storage so the consent banner does not reappear on every page. Clearing your browser storage for this site removes it.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="legal-section">
        <h2>What this website does not do</h2>
        <ul class="legal-list">
          <li>Sell personal information to third parties</li>
          <li>Create advertising profiles</li>
          <li>Track individuals across other websites</li>
          <li>Use behavioral targeting advertising</li>
          <li>Load any analytics or tracking script</li>
          <li>Retain contact form data beyond the purpose of responding</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="legal-section">
        <h2>Cordel Connect</h2>
        <p>Cordel Connect is in private Android test and beta development only. It is not available on any public app store. A separate, app-specific privacy policy will be published before any broader beta release or public app launch. Beta participants are informed of data handling specific to their testing role.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="legal-section">
        <h2>Founder reservations</h2>
        <p>Founder reservations for eligible preorder-eligible products (see <a href="/preorder">Preorder</a>) currently go through the contact form rather than a dedicated reservation system, since no paid preorder exists yet. The same contact-form data handling described above applies.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="legal-section">
        <h2>Restaurant Partner Program</h2>
        <p>The Cordel Restaurant Partner Program signup collects restaurant account details, business profile information, uploaded logo and photos, and the promotional deal a participating restaurant chooses to offer. That data is held by the program's own backend service rather than by this website.</p>
        <p>Stripe is the checkout processor for the program. Stripe is currently operating in <strong>test mode</strong>: completing checkout does not process a real card charge and does not create a real restaurant listing. Card details are entered on Stripe's own hosted checkout; ByteLite LLC does not receive or store card data in either test or live mode. This policy will be updated before live charging is enabled.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="legal-section">
        <h2>Third-party services</h2>
        <p>This website is served by a third-party hosting provider, which necessarily processes request data such as IP addresses in the ordinary course of serving pages. Web fonts are loaded from Google Fonts. Stripe is used as the checkout processor for the Restaurant Partner Program, as described above. ByteLite LLC does not use advertising networks on this website, and no advertising or tracking script is served by any page.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="legal-section">
        <h2>Your rights</h2>
        <p>You may request deletion of any contact form data submitted by emailing through the <a href="/contact">contact page</a>. ByteLite LLC will respond within a reasonable timeframe.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="legal-section">
        <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p>This policy may be updated as ByteLite LLC's products develop. The updated date at the top of this page reflects the most recent revision. Material changes will be noted.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="legal-section">
        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>Privacy questions may be directed through the <a href="/contact">contact page</a>. ByteLite LLC is based in Helena, Montana, USA.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer slot="footer" />
</Layout>

<style>

.legal-hero { padding: 5rem 0 3.5rem; }
.legal-hero h1 { max-width: 480px; }
.legal-sub { margin-top: .75rem; font-size: .9375rem; color: #555e7a; }
.legal-body { max-width: 760px; }
.legal-section { margin-bottom: 3rem; }
.legal-section h2 { font-size: 1.375rem; color: #e4e7f2; margin-bottom: 1rem; padding-bottom: .75rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #1a2235; }
.legal-section h3 { font-size: 1.0625rem; color: #e4e7f2; margin: 1.5rem 0 .5rem; }
.legal-section p { font-size: .9375rem; color: #7b829e; line-height: 1.75; margin-bottom: .875rem; }
.legal-section a { color: #818cf8; }
.legal-section a:hover { color: #a5b4fc; }
.legal-list { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: .625rem; }
.legal-list li { font-size: .9375rem; color: #7b829e; padding-left: 1.25rem; position: relative; line-height: 1.6; }
.legal-list li::before { content: "—"; position: absolute; left: 0; color: #4a5068; }

</style>
